(PROTOCOL CS-2026-88 | CLINICAL STUDY REPORT) Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* (SECTION 3: SUBJECT COHORT & DEMOGRAPHICS) Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3.1 Enrolled Cohort Population) Tj
T* (A total cohort of N=120 subjects were enrolled, consented, and randomized:) Tj
T* (- Active Treatment Group \(Formula B-88\): n = 60 subjects) Tj
T* (- Vehicle Placebo Group: n = 60 subjects) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3.2 Protocol Adherence & Analysis Populations) Tj
T* (- Enrolled Population \(ITT\): N=120 subjects) Tj
T* (- Per-Protocol \(PP\) Population: N=118 subjects \(98.3% protocol compliance\)) Tj
T* (- Dropouts / Discontinuations: 2 subjects \(1 relocation, 1 unrelated personal illness\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3.3 Baseline Demographic Distribution) Tj
T* (- Gender Distribution: 65 Female \(54.2%\), 55 Male \(45.8%\)) Tj
T* (- Age Range: 18 - 54 years \(Mean: 29.4 +/- 6.8 years\)) Tj
T* (- Fitzpatrick Skin Phototypes: Types III \(38%\), IV \(42%\), V \(20%\)) Tj
T* (- Baseline Stratum Corneum Hydration: Active 31.4 +/- 4.2 | Placebo 31.8 +/- 4.0 a.u.) Tj
T* (- Baseline Casual Sebum Excretion: Active 188.2 +/- 22.5 | Placebo 186.4 +/- 21.0 ug/cm2) Tj
T* (- Baseline Inflammatory Acne Count: Active 25.0 +/- 3.8 | Placebo 24.6 +/- 3.5 lesions) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Page 4 of 8) Tj
