(PROTOCOL CS-2026-88 | CLINICAL STUDY REPORT) Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* (SECTION 4: TIMELINE & EVALUATION SCHEDULE) Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4.1 Duration of Clinical Study) Tj
T* (The mandated clinical trial duration was exactly 14 days \(Day 0 baseline to Day 14 final\).) Tj
T* (Claims promising clinical significance before the 14-day protocol completion are unsubstantiated.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4.2 Visit Schedule & Milestones) Tj
T* (- Visit 1 \(Day 0 - Baseline\): Comprehensive biophysical measurements and product dispensing.) Tj
T* (- Visit 2 \(Day 3 - Interim\): Early tolerance and compliance check \(non-significant endpoint\).) Tj
T* (- Visit 3 \(Day 7 - Midpoint\): Interim barrier function and sebum assessment.) Tj
T* (- Visit 4 \(Day 14 - Study Endpoint\): Final primary endpoint assessment and lesion counts.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4.3 Product Application Protocol) Tj
T* (Subjects applied 3 to 4 drops of test formulation to the entire facial area twice daily) Tj
T* (\(morning and evening\) immediately after washing with a neutral cleansing syndet.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Page 5 of 8) Tj
