(PROTOCOL CS-2026-88 | CLINICAL STUDY REPORT) Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* (SECTION 5: INSTRUMENTATION & STATISTICAL METHODOLOGY) Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5.1 Non-Invasive Cutaneous Bio-Engineering Probes) Tj
T* (- Corneometer CM 825 \(Courage + Khazaka electronic GmbH, Cologne, Germany\):) Tj
T* (  Capacitance measurement of the dielectric constant of stratum corneum.) Tj
T* (- Sebumeter SM 815 \(Courage + Khazaka electronic GmbH\):) Tj
T* (  Photometric grease-spot measurement of casual sebum excretion.) Tj
T* (- Tewameter TM 300: Transepidermal water loss \(TEWL\) open chamber method.) Tj
T* (- Global Acne Grading System \(GAGS\) and High-Resolution Digital Dermatological Imaging.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5.2 Statistical Analysis Plan) Tj
T* (- Continuous variables are expressed as Mean +/- Standard Deviation \(SD\).) Tj
T* (- Within-group differences from baseline were analyzed using Paired Student t-test.) Tj
T* (- Between-group comparisons were evaluated using Two-Way Repeated Measures ANOVA.) Tj
T* (- Statistical significance threshold: alpha = 0.05. High significance: p < 0.001.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Page 6 of 8) Tj
ET
